<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>This macro for the game «Locked» in Roblox performs sequential actions. First, he lifts the ball into the air, and then dribbles it in the air in any direction your character is facing. You require the vevohub autoflick for thiss to work. Please note that errors are possible, especially with high ping. It is recommended to set 800 DPI and 171 sensitivity in the Roblox settings. The 1920 x 1080 resolution is considered convenient, but other options can be used, since mouse movement is based on relative coordinates. Be attentive to the settings to achieve the best results!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
